

Programma opromje.


>> Griente := Objekt nĳ.
Griente by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: {
	>> v := sels nĳ.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Griente by: ['init'] dwaan: { eigen grienten := 0. }.

Griente by: ['carrots:'] dwaan: { :a eigen grienten := a. <- Neat. }.
Griente by: ['woartels'] dwaan: { <- eigen grienten. }.
Griente by: ['+'] dwaan: { :f
	>> n := Griente nĳ.
	n carrots: (f woartels + eigen grienten). <- n.
}.

Griente by: ['tekst'] dwaan: { <- eigen grienten tekst.
}.

Getal by: ['woartels'] dwaan: {
	>> x := Griente nĳ.
	x carrots: sels. <- x.
}.

Getal by: ['optelle:en:'] dwaan: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 optelle: (3 woartels + 2 woartels) en: 4 woartels.
Utfier skriuwe: q, nije-rigel.
